  nextButton: {fileID: 0}
  prevButton: {fileID: 0}
  pages:
  - pageTitle: Kingdom Construction
    pageDescription: Welcome, Commander! Learn to build, interact with, and upgrade
      your kingdom's structures to strengthen your empire.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8e1f94bbd13afbd4582af73a77b9e669, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Managing Resources
    pageDescription: Keep an eye on your Gold, Gems, and Energy. You will need these
      to construct buildings and maintain your kingdom.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c56c505500d850479220a359cad735f, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Proceed on Building
    pageDescription: You can now proceed on building by clicking the building button.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bafabc35b0680084bb2efb76466759be, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Place Buildings
    pageDescription: You can place buildings by clicking the button inside the building
      panel.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bafabc35b0680084bb2efb76466759be, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Training Troops
    pageDescription: Train units at the Barracks! Each unit possesses distinct Health,
      Attack Power, Range, and Movement stats suited for combat.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bafabc35b0680084bb2efb76466759be, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Power Up Your Army
    pageDescription: Upgrade your troops in the structure menu to boost their combat
      stats and prepare them for tougher battles ahead.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bafabc35b0680084bb2efb76466759be, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Entering the Battlefield
    pageDescription: Head to the Level Select map and choose your first target stage
      to launch an attack against enemy forces.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bafabc35b0680084bb2efb76466759be, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Drafting Troops
    pageDescription: Select your squad carefully! Choose units up to the maximum
      deployment capacity allowed for this battle stage.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bafabc35b0680084bb2efb76466759be, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Combat & Grid Rules
    pageDescription: Place units on highlighted tiles during Setup. On your turn,
      move along blue tile paths and attack targets within red range paths.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bafabc35b0680084bb2efb76466759be, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Claiming Victory
    pageDescription: Great victory! Winning battles grants Coins, Gems, and Energy
      rewards to keep growing your forces.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bafabc35b0680084bb2efb76466759be, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Kingdom Energy
    pageDescription: Energy limits farm productivity and daily kingdom activities.
      Plan your energy usage wisely to keep your production running!
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bafabc35b0680084bb2efb76466759be, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Full Command
    pageDescription: You now have complete command over your kingdom, army, and research
      path. Go forth and conquer, Commander!
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bafabc35b0680084bb2efb76466759be, type: 3}
